WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.490
Unit twenty-two. Screens and My Eyes!

2
00:00:04.444 --> 00:00:08.344
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.394 --> 00:00:11.698
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.748 --> 00:00:15.672
Today we learn about Screens and My Eyes. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:19.907
Screen. Say it with me. Screen!

6
00:00:23.407 --> 00:00:26.623
Eyes. Say it with me. Eyes!

7
00:00:30.135 --> 00:00:33.385
Break. Say it with me. Break!

8
00:00:36.884 --> 00:00:40.600
Distance. Say it with me. Distance!

9
00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.360
Blink. Say it with me. Blink!

10
00:00:50.848 --> 00:00:54.615
Outdoor. Say it with me. Outdoor!

11
00:00:58.127 --> 00:01:01.494
Sleep. Say it with me. Sleep!

12
00:01:04.994 --> 00:01:08.444
Limit. Say it with me. Limit!

13
00:01:11.981 --> 00:01:20.662
Looking at a screen for a long time can make my eyes tired. I keep a good distance, blink, and take a break. I limit screen time and play outdoor games too.

14
00:01:20.712 --> 00:01:21.875
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:28.448
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.498 --> 00:01:29.648
Break!

17
00:01:30.397 --> 00:01:35.670
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:36.870
Sleep!

19
00:01:37.588 --> 00:01:44.426
Did you know? A simple rule is to look at something far away every 20 minutes when using a screen!

20
00:01:44.476 --> 00:01:46.417
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.103 --> 00:01:54.927
Think and answer. How often do you take a break from screens?

22
00:01:54.977 --> 00:01:56.127
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.403 --> 00:02:02.490
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:05.276
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

